                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "подземельна"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "56cf461f-4c94-4c80-97ea-ea7f87526fd1",
                        "entry_id": "0d771756-7c36-3038-9f26-bd763483b3cb",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "подземельны"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b55f8866-89bb-3c52-b08c-ca430d1a6ce7",
                        "entry_id": "0d771756-7c36-3038-9f26-bd763483b3cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "связанный, соотносящийся по значению с существительным подземелье; свойственный, характерный для него"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2339d41-b641-44f4-85ee-ac1b5027320e",
                                "sense_id": "b55f8866-89bb-3c52-b08c-ca430d1a6ce7",
                                "text": "Моё посещение было тогда сопряжено с опасностями, а теперь, заплатив 20 полуимпериалов, я был свободно допущен обозреть в большом обществе не только обе мечети, но и подземельные построения горы Мориа, которые я тогда не мог видеть."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df6cc2a4-848f-41f0-8b9c-b46cad829426",
                                "sense_id": "b55f8866-89bb-3c52-b08c-ca430d1a6ce7",
                                "text": "Подземельные ходы не отличались разнообразием: повсюду стены были выложены грубыми ноздреватыми булыжниками, кое-где среди крысиного помёта валялись обгоревшие факелы и дохлые летучие мыши."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a053be04-b83c-33ad-a63b-571df9a23e57",
                        "entry_id": "0d771756-7c36-3038-9f26-bd763483b3cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. то же, что подземный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "83e79f67-fdb2-4d4f-bdc8-af7cd5e38f0c",
                                "sense_id": "a053be04-b83c-33ad-a63b-571df9a23e57",
                                "text": "Но меня не слушали и кинули меня в некоторый род подземельной тюрьмы."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "829363ef-8f30-450e-9429-d5f7b1b357dd",
                                "sense_id": "a053be04-b83c-33ad-a63b-571df9a23e57",
                                "text": "И воды, уже всю землю потопившие, и приближение самой кометы сжимали землю столько, что она, приняв вид еллиптического шара, не могла далее терпеть ни внешнего давления, ни внутреннего усилия, треснула по всей длине своей и разлитием подземельных вод усугубила ещё более на поверхности своей наводнение."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "175aa129-3c43-4508-9a93-9d4b2700209a",
                                "sense_id": "a053be04-b83c-33ad-a63b-571df9a23e57",
                                "text": "Хотя время почти совсем истребило сей древний дом, уничтожив и следы архитектуры его, однакожь по стенным отломкам, пиластрам, частям свода и подземельным ходам можно, с помощию воображения, представить сие здание так, как оно существовало."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cfa3ca42-0c0f-486f-891b-36f69bdcc5c4",
                        "source_entry_id": "0d771756-7c36-3038-9f26-bd763483b3cb",
                        "source_sense_description": "подземный",
                        "target_lang_word": "subterranean",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "subterranean",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5032baf8-6f6c-3246-9592-a648dd1bb501",
                                        "entry_id": "98c186e8-ea19-3a6a-9550-2eafe76baa1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Below ground, under the earth, underground."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0928a078-4d6a-4394-9053-f2548e7ce7ad",
                                                "sense_id": "5032baf8-6f6c-3246-9592-a648dd1bb501",
                                                "text": "Again the bearers took up the coffin, and cold and damp the subterranean air came from the opened vault. The tapers were lowered, and shed a ghastly light on the rows of piled coffins, and the moisture glittering on the walls."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1bea649-bdef-4625-a7ad-7361435f26b4",
                                                "sense_id": "5032baf8-6f6c-3246-9592-a648dd1bb501",
                                                "text": "And you were in the parking lot / Subterranean by your own design"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a177869-2029-4689-88f7-bf011fa7fc8c",
                                                "sense_id": "5032baf8-6f6c-3246-9592-a648dd1bb501",
                                                "text": "This is a story of north-south connection, and it begins with the fact that late in 1863 the Great Northern Railway completed a subterranean connection from its terminus at King's Cross to the tracks of the Metropolitan enabling the Great Northern to run through to the Met's easterly terminus at Farringdon Street."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "636208bb-c807-4f43-bbe9-05ceb69b3832",
                                                "sense_id": "5032baf8-6f6c-3246-9592-a648dd1bb501",
                                                "text": "The best way to neutralise its [nuclear waste's] threat is to move it into a subterranean vault, of the kind the UK plans to build later this century. Once interred, the waste will be left alone for tens of thousands of years, while its radioactivity cools."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fc99818-937c-4dd0-8efd-355a1cdf93bc",
                                                "sense_id": "5032baf8-6f6c-3246-9592-a648dd1bb501",
                                                "text": "Today is that most sacred of American holidays. A day when people from all walks of life set aside their differences and focus their undivided attention on the prognostication abilities of a subterranean rodent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e29c48e8-23b4-30dd-8535-76309895a625",
                                        "entry_id": "98c186e8-ea19-3a6a-9550-2eafe76baa1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Secret, concealed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac9cd314-1821-40d8-9fba-7d0198a0d9df",
                                                "sense_id": "e29c48e8-23b4-30dd-8535-76309895a625",
                                                "text": "The subterranean tool of buying rigged opinion polling and media coverage is outlined in remarkable detail in chat exchanges recovered from the cellphone of one of Mr. Kurz’s closest allies and friends, Thomas Schmid."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "subterranean",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dabb74c7-e7f2-39bf-ac27-96f7a011e5e9",
                                        "entry_id": "e30519b8-a6fd-313d-a60f-a354e61d87f1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that is subterranean."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01cd8ff2-67f5-43be-8c06-d9365d2593ea",
                                                "sense_id": "dabb74c7-e7f2-39bf-ac27-96f7a011e5e9",
                                                "text": "[H]e continues Lean like a Hawke or Heron, notwith ſtanding his devouring Appetite: yet it would ſeem that they convey that ſubſtance elſewhere, for theſe Subterraneans eat but little in their Dwellings; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f942b30-448f-4077-ac0b-a5229b2cd665",
                                                "sense_id": "dabb74c7-e7f2-39bf-ac27-96f7a011e5e9",
                                                "text": "Whatever elſe the Tauric Cimmerium have been right or wrong called, it is no leſs ſurely a capital of darkneſs, than, near the famous Baths of Baiae, in Campania, the Cimmerium, where the inhabitants were truly Cimmerian; as miners, or other ſubterraneans; who, for good or evil purpoſe, never faced the ſun."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d985800c-7c47-4a6a-85e2-86b53b26ccab",
                                                "sense_id": "dabb74c7-e7f2-39bf-ac27-96f7a011e5e9",
                                                "text": "Prue found an ample subterranean, neatly furnished; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "386654e9-a086-4e56-af13-d49b91ed166b",
                                                "sense_id": "dabb74c7-e7f2-39bf-ac27-96f7a011e5e9",
                                                "text": "Above: a stretch of the walls of the old Cathedral of S. Reparata in the subterraneans of the Duomo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9c2da139-2779-480a-91df-6998aece9537",
                        "source_entry_id": "0d771756-7c36-3038-9f26-bd763483b3cb",
                        "source_sense_description": "подземный",
                        "target_lang_word": "underground",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "underground",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "47fdeecc-f578-3f82-9261-4b4a861c6f59",
                                        "entry_id": "e5c65c07-1cd3-3b94-9501-85061911769a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Below the ground; below the surface of the Earth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47fa0a21-ed47-4473-8908-5e1bbdc179c8",
                                                "sense_id": "47fdeecc-f578-3f82-9261-4b4a861c6f59",
                                                "text": "There is an underground tunnel that takes you across the river."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3402e746-7682-40b6-b846-4f836f58781b",
                                                "sense_id": "47fdeecc-f578-3f82-9261-4b4a861c6f59",
                                                "text": "One of the hidden glories of Victorian engineering is proper drains. Isolating a city’s effluent and shipping it away in underground sewers has probably saved more lives than any medical procedure except vaccination."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "290da73f-22f9-3b20-92dd-02663eca8b88",
                                        "entry_id": "e5c65c07-1cd3-3b94-9501-85061911769a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hidden, furtive, secretive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ffda865-118d-4e8c-885c-89b42c56e5d0",
                                                "sense_id": "290da73f-22f9-3b20-92dd-02663eca8b88",
                                                "text": "These criminals operate through an underground network."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d0b7f2a-38d3-3218-8a8f-174656c58268",
                                        "entry_id": "e5c65c07-1cd3-3b94-9501-85061911769a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Outside the mainstream, especially unofficial and hidden from the authorities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3f80991-4891-4b8f-9c22-a50d3b639f60",
                                                "sense_id": "2d0b7f2a-38d3-3218-8a8f-174656c58268",
                                                "text": "underground music"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20331db4-ef86-4a8b-9536-d272bc85547f",
                                                "sense_id": "2d0b7f2a-38d3-3218-8a8f-174656c58268",
                                                "text": "‘[…]he wrote to me last week telling me about an incredible bitch of a row blazing there on account of someone having been and gone and produced an unofficial magazine called Raddled, full of obscene libellous Oz-like filth. And what I though, what Sammy and I thought, was—why not?’ ‘Why not what?’ said Tom. ‘Why not do the same thing here?’ ‘You mean an underground magazine?’ ‘Yup.’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5863037c-8f54-4f63-bc41-412d288f8e15",
                                                "sense_id": "2d0b7f2a-38d3-3218-8a8f-174656c58268",
                                                "text": "\"In many ways, it showed there was no longer an underground, as such. This proved that there was no longer one society with everyone agreeing how to live . . . The underground had officially come above ground, and consequently no longer existed.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
